# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PARTICIPANT-LEVEL DATA - NEVER COMMIT
#
# These files contain individual-level clinical variables (age, vaginal pH,
# antibiotic use, BV history) keyed to sample identifiers that also key the ENA
# submission PRJEB108308. They were not published with the article and are
# available only under controlled access (see README, "Controlled access").
#
# The public, de-identified derivatives are produced by
# scripts/make_public_objects.R and ARE committed:
#   metadata/sample_metadata_public.rda
#   objects/genome_metabolome_results_public.rda
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
metadata/sample_metadata.rda
objects/genome_metabolome_results.rda
data/MatchMetaData.SeqMetaDATA.xlsx

# Raw upstream inputs consumed by scripts/00_* (ENA / authors, not redistributed)
data/*read_counts.txt
data/*_species.tsv
data/polar_*_results.tsv

# Intermediate objects regenerated by scripts/00_* (not part of the release)
objects/BACT_complete_meta.rda
objects/bact_object.rda
objects/*ancombc2*.rda
objects/merged_*.rda
objects/tune_ncomp_*.rda
objects/bv_path_res.rda

# Runtime outputs of scripts/02_*: the 39 MB correlation matrix is published as
# Zenodo Supplementary Data 4 (doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20734655), not here.
supplementary_tables/gene_metabolite_correlations.csv
supplementary_tables/gene_metabolite_correlations_q0.1.xlsx

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# FIGURES - allowlist, not denylist
#
# The scripts generate intermediate figures into figures/, and one of them
# (figures/MOFA2_pH_analysis.png, written by 01_*.R when the private metadata is
# present) plots one jittered point per participant's vaginal pH. Ignoring the
# whole directory and re-including only the eight published figures makes it
# impossible for a generated figure to be swept in by `git add .`.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
figures/*
!figures/Figure1.png
!figures/Figure2.png
!figures/Figure3.png
!figures/Figure4.png
!figures/Figure5.png
!figures/Figure6.png
!figures/Figure7.png
!figures/FigureS1.png

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor / OS / R session cruft
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
*.Rproj
*~
*.swp
